          "line_end": 23,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "yaoapp/yao",
          "url": "https://github.com/YaoApp/yao/blob/5774ce8de5a4d832a1808d942f87c60de86c78e7/README.md#L23-L23"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9e0e175ab15277c1918664599b93b2138f75c85e2972ba56625cc5303244d3d7"
      ],
      "text": "Agents run on the user's own devices, with each added machine serving as another place for agents to work, all managed from one place."
    },
    {
